-
-\vspace{0.2cm}
-
-\begin{block}{Syntax}
+\textbf{A recipe for the project}
+\begin{itemize}
+\item Targets declare dependencies and commands
+\item Read a target before running it
+\item Inspect outputs after a successful build
+\end{itemize}
